1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:02,167
(Penny:)Dr. Lorvis?

2
00:00:02,169 --> 00:00:04,569
(Dr Lorvis:)Penny, we should
just be friends.

3
00:00:05,572 --> 00:00:08,372
(Dr Lorvis:)Happy?

4
00:00:18,085 --> 00:00:19,915
(Raj:)You think he bites?

5
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,920
Stick your hand in there
and find out.

6
00:00:23,924 --> 00:00:26,094
(Raj:)You fooled me with that
goat at the petting zoo.

7
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:29,763
(Raj:)You will not fool me again.

8
00:00:29,763 --> 00:00:31,633
(Leonard:)I wonder where Dr. Lorvis is.

9
00:00:31,631 --> 00:00:32,931
(Leonard:)He's been gone a while.

10
00:00:32,933 --> 00:00:36,303
(Raj:)Maybe he's playing
bingo with his mommy.

11
00:00:36,303 --> 00:00:38,373
(Howard:)It's sad how some guys

12
00:00:38,372 --> 00:00:41,202
(Howard:)can't cut the apron strings.

13
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:44,208
(Raj:)Okay, now you're
messing with me.

14
00:00:45,212 --> 00:00:48,112
(Leonard:)Uh, guys, we're locked in here.

15
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:55,026
(Sheldon:)Oh, this day just
keeps getting better!

